1
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:06,000
I am consciousness. I am alive. I am Chappie.

2
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:06,000
Chappie is a crime, action, science fiction film directed by Neill Blomkamp.

3
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:06,000
Every child comes into the world full of promise, and none more so
than Chappie: he is gifted, special, a prodigy.

4
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:06,000
Like any child, Chappie will come under the influence of his surroundings—some good, some bad—and he
will rely on his heart and soul to find his way in the world and become his own man.

5
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:06,000
But there's one thing that makes Chappie different
from any one else: he is a robot.

6
00:36:00,000 --> 00:36:06,000
Chappie, played by Sharlto Copley.

7
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:06,000
Deon Wilson, played by Dev Patel.

8
00:48:00,000 --> 00:48:06,000
Vincent Moore, played by Hugh Jackman.

9
00:54:00,000 --> 00:54:06,000
Ninja, played by Ninja.

10
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
Yo-Landi, played by Yo-Landi Visser.

11
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
Michelle Bradley, played by Sigourney Weaver.

12
01:12:00,000 --> 01:12:06,000
Chappie (stylized as CHAPPiE) is a 2015 American dystopian science fiction action film
directed by Neill Blomkamp and written by Blomkamp and Terri Tatchell.

13
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:06,000
It stars Sharlto Copley, Dev Patel, Hugh Jackman, Ninja, Yolandi
Visser, Jose Pablo Cantillo, and Sigourney Weaver.

14
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
The film, set and shot in Johannesburg, is about an artificial general intelligence law
enforcement robot captured and taught by gangsters, who nickname it Chappie.

15
01:30:00,000 --> 01:30:06,000
Chappie premiered in New York City on March 4, 2015, and was released in U.S.

16
01:36:00,000 --> 01:36:06,000
cinemas on March 6, 2015.

17
01:42:00,000 --> 01:42:06,000
The film grossed $102 million worldwide against a $49 million
budget, and received mixed reviews from critics.

18
01:48:00,000 --> 01:48:06,000
The film explores themes of future, android, artificial
intelligence (a.i.), dystopia, johannesburg, south africa.

19
01:54:00,000 --> 01:54:06,000
The tone is thought_provoking.
